===Format===
[[File:RLCS Swiss Format.jpg|thumbnail|335px|A graphical explanation of the Swiss System format]]
*'''Swiss Stage''' - ''March 28th - 29th, 2024''
** 16 Team Swiss System Format.
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo5}}.
** <span class="bg-up">Top 8</span> Teams proceed to the [[Rocket_League_Championship_Series/2024/Major 1#Playoffs|Playoffs]].
<br>
*'''Playoffs''' - ''March 30th - 31st, 2024''
**Single Elimination Bracket.
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo7}}.
<br>
''Crowd Days: March 30th - 31st''

